## make help
  help         daftar perintah
  certs        buat CA + sertifikat server dev (self-signed) bila belum ada
  up           build dan nyalakan semua service inti
  down         matikan service (volume dipertahankan)
  logs         ikuti log semua service
  ps           status service
  config       validasi dan render compose
  build        build image saja
  demo-reset   hapus volume DB+MQTT, naik bersih, migrasi, seed demo (bila ada)
  demo-up      service inti + simulator (profile sim)
  sim-up       hanya simulator (service inti harus sudah jalan)
  obs-up       prometheus + grafana (profile obs)
  venv         virtualenv Python untuk lint/test lokal
  lint         eslint + prettier + ruff
  test         vitest + pytest (placeholder)
  test-rls     uji isolasi RLS (stub; db/tests/rls.sql diisi plan 011)
  check-compose validasi compose: statis (node) + `docker compose config` bila Docker ada
  test-scripts uji skrip infra tanpa Docker (certs, role password, wait-healthy)
  ci           lint + build + test + validasi compose + uji skrip + test-rls (lokal, pengganti CI hosted)
